Developing the 25MW / 52MWh Lake Bonney Battery Energy Storage System in SA;   
Purchasing the 123MW Smithfield Gas Turbine plant in NSW;   
Committing to a long-term lease of four SA Gas Turbines (120MW) from the South Australian Government, and preparing to move the GTs to a new site and convert to dual fuel;   
Developing the 113MW Bodangora Wind Farm in New South Wales; Selling the 57MW Cherry Tree Wind Farm project and entering into a longterm PPA as the off-taker of its energy.
